WEBVTT

01:26.670 --> 01:29.690
[Glory]

01:30.610 --> 01:32.990
[Episode 34]

01:36.350 --> 01:37.350
Master Jianglai.

01:41.280 --> 01:42.940
Huiqing refused to toast you.

01:43.560 --> 01:44.870
Let me give you a toast.

01:45.400 --> 01:46.460
Will you accept it?

01:48.310 --> 01:49.789
You're the bold one.

01:50.479 --> 01:51.430
Do you know

01:51.430 --> 01:53.289
that Miss Rong by Jianglai's side

01:53.479 --> 01:55.000
always has a whip with her?

01:56.200 --> 01:58.920
I've heard that every Rong Family woman
is extremely jealous,

01:58.920 --> 02:00.980
and men fear her as if she were a tiger.

02:02.070 --> 02:03.200
I'm afraid Jianglai

02:03.920 --> 02:05.720
won't dare to accept your toast.

02:06.840 --> 02:08.160
These are mere trifles,

02:08.160 --> 02:10.190
not worth your anger, Master Jianglai.

02:10.190 --> 02:12.310
Master Shuyu composed this music himself

02:12.310 --> 02:13.360
and had someone bring out

02:13.360 --> 02:15.750
this fine wine
that has been preserved for 10 years.

02:15.750 --> 02:18.079
He has long awaited
this reunion of brothers.

02:18.079 --> 02:19.520
Do not spoil his mood.

02:20.630 --> 02:21.910
Please drink this up.

02:22.200 --> 02:24.079
You'll be close brothers again.

02:28.030 --> 02:28.590
Shuyu.

02:29.960 --> 02:31.490
I think you're truly drunk.

02:31.710 --> 02:33.120
You should rest early tonight.

02:33.120 --> 02:33.980
Whatever it is,

02:34.829 --> 02:36.829
we can discuss it when you're sober.

02:38.710 --> 02:40.840
He is so cold.

02:41.520 --> 02:43.050
I did nothing to offend him,

02:43.590 --> 02:46.390
yet he treated me
as if I were some filthy creature.

02:46.910 --> 02:49.800
Master Shuyu, what about this wine?

02:57.390 --> 02:59.130
[Fuping Pavilion]

03:02.280 --> 03:03.210
Uncle Jianglai.

03:11.030 --> 03:11.960
Uncle Jianglai!

03:20.090 --> 03:21.890
Xun, why are you here?

03:22.360 --> 03:23.290
Uncle Jianglai,

03:23.310 --> 03:24.560
you ate nothing

03:24.560 --> 03:25.800
at the table just now.

03:25.870 --> 03:26.870
This is for you.

04:18.160 --> 04:19.880
Xun, this jujube cake is from you.

04:19.880 --> 04:21.279
I will definitely eat it.

04:25.160 --> 04:27.360
It's cold outside. Go back early.

04:36.120 --> 04:37.190
Lady Shanbao, why are you not waiting
in your chamber

04:37.190 --> 04:38.390
for Lord Lu to return?

04:38.460 --> 04:40.790
He specifically asked you to wait inside.

04:41.240 --> 04:42.430
My mind is in a whirl.

04:43.190 --> 04:44.320
I want to take a walk.

04:45.159 --> 04:45.920
Xiu Qiong.

04:46.800 --> 04:47.560
Tonight,

04:48.100 --> 04:50.150
did you notice if he seemed very happy

04:50.150 --> 04:51.680
when he left for the dinner?

04:52.750 --> 04:54.630
Lord Lu lost his mother when he was young.

04:54.630 --> 04:56.680
His foster father was killed
by a powerful clan.

04:56.680 --> 04:59.040
Left all alone in the world
and with no one to rely on,

04:59.040 --> 05:00.370
he endured nothing but bullying
from his relatives

05:00.370 --> 05:01.970
and cold stares from others.

05:02.000 --> 05:03.630
Against all odds, he passed
the imperial exam and became an official.

05:03.630 --> 05:05.310
He avenged his father,
brought corrupt officials to justice,

05:05.310 --> 05:06.600
and devoted himself to his duties.

05:06.600 --> 05:08.430
Now he has finally reunited
with his own elder brother.

05:08.430 --> 05:09.630
Of course he's happy.

05:11.000 --> 05:11.950
Yes,

05:12.720 --> 05:13.390
he's happy.

05:14.800 --> 05:16.800
He's a reserved and reticent person.

05:16.800 --> 05:17.860
I've never seen him

05:18.390 --> 05:20.070
show such obvious joy before.

05:20.800 --> 05:22.920
Lady Shanbao, what troubles you?

05:24.390 --> 05:26.050
I hope I'm just overthinking.

05:26.390 --> 05:27.510
May heaven be kind

05:28.600 --> 05:29.360
and let him

05:30.040 --> 05:31.700
keep this joy a little longer.

05:32.190 --> 05:33.800
Lady Shanbao, your words sound odd.

05:33.800 --> 05:35.000
I don't quite follow.

06:24.390 --> 06:25.560
Here come the jujube paste cakes.

06:25.560 --> 06:26.890
The jujube paste cakes!

06:27.270 --> 06:28.470
Be careful. It's hot!

06:29.160 --> 06:30.040
It's so hot!

06:30.040 --> 06:30.800
Mother.

06:30.800 --> 06:32.480
It burned my tongue.

06:32.480 --> 06:33.390
Let me see.

06:34.240 --> 06:35.800
No need to rush.

06:38.070 --> 06:39.560
Let me cool it off for you.

06:43.270 --> 06:44.159
Take your time.

06:47.800 --> 06:48.430
Is it good?

06:48.630 --> 06:50.000
It's really good!

06:50.000 --> 06:52.260
Mother, your cooking is always the best.

07:25.160 --> 07:25.720
Mother.

07:27.790 --> 07:29.520
Shuyu also likes jujube cakes.

07:32.360 --> 07:34.159
I learned that my mother back home

07:34.159 --> 07:36.270
has been suffering
from her migraines again.

07:36.270 --> 07:37.870
I thought of how this distant marriage

07:37.870 --> 07:39.600
keeps me from my filial duties.

07:39.830 --> 07:41.070
Miss Rong, I lost my composure

07:41.070 --> 07:42.400
in front of you just now.

07:42.830 --> 07:44.230
Sorry you had to see that.

07:45.310 --> 07:46.270
Mrs. Xue.

07:47.950 --> 07:49.159
When I was only 13,

07:49.600 --> 07:52.400
my grandmother forced me
to escort tea shipments.

07:52.800 --> 07:53.750
I had no choice but to leave

07:53.750 --> 07:54.560
my nanny and maids

07:54.560 --> 07:56.220
who had cared for me for years.

07:56.460 --> 07:57.780
I cried my eyes out.

07:58.720 --> 08:00.450
The world collapsed around me.

08:00.510 --> 08:02.170
Darkness swallowed me whole.

08:02.310 --> 08:03.640
My will to live was gone.

08:04.600 --> 08:07.160
I still remember that year

08:07.390 --> 08:09.520
we joined the autumn-winter caravan.

08:09.900 --> 08:11.560
It was over 3,000 kilometers,

08:11.680 --> 08:13.280
a journey that took 3 months.

08:13.830 --> 08:15.560
Along the way were grasslands, mountains,

08:15.560 --> 08:17.360
wild forests and desolate ruins.

08:17.360 --> 08:19.620
It felt like the journey would never end.

09:21.320 --> 09:22.750
Thank you, Miss Rong.

09:23.360 --> 09:24.940
Thanks for saving me
from further embarrassment

09:24.940 --> 09:27.340
and even going out
of your way to comfort me.

09:28.150 --> 09:29.030
Actually,

09:30.000 --> 09:31.000
Master Shuyu

09:32.110 --> 09:33.680
wasn't always like this.

09:35.460 --> 09:36.770
[Bogu Studio]

09:37.960 --> 09:38.960
Let's go back now.

09:42.550 --> 09:43.390
Oh no!

09:44.190 --> 09:46.580
My Lady, what should we do?

09:47.150 --> 09:48.510
If we're caught

09:48.720 --> 09:50.240
getting back late,

09:50.910 --> 09:51.710
we'll never be

09:52.270 --> 09:54.150
allowed to go out again.

09:56.630 --> 09:58.480
My master happened to see you
in a predicament.

09:58.480 --> 09:59.720
He specifically sent me
to bring you this umbrella

09:59.720 --> 10:01.030
to help you out.

10:01.960 --> 10:03.440
Who is your master?

10:03.790 --> 10:05.510
A kind act needs no name attached to it.

10:05.510 --> 10:07.170
Please just take it and use it.

10:09.120 --> 10:09.790
Thank you.

10:44.030 --> 10:45.870
He's a kind man
who chooses to remain anonymous.

10:45.870 --> 10:47.630
My Lady, let's hurry back.

10:51.500 --> 10:53.270
Later, the Duke's family
came to propose marriage.

10:51.540 --> 10:53.550
[Hengsheng]

10:54.870 --> 10:55.630
I've always despised

10:55.630 --> 10:56.600
those spoiled and ignorant

10:56.600 --> 10:57.600
sons of nobility.

10:58.150 --> 10:59.720
So I deliberately stayed a year
at my maternal grandparents' home,

10:59.720 --> 11:01.120
refusing to return home.

11:02.000 --> 11:04.750
Later, my father
tested Master Shuyu's scholarship

11:04.750 --> 11:06.960
and tricked me
into watching it from behind a screen.

11:06.960 --> 11:08.690
I recognized him immediately.

11:09.080 --> 11:11.680
It turned out
his courtesy name was Hengsheng.

11:12.420 --> 11:14.220
After I learned the whole story,

11:15.150 --> 11:17.350
I thought he was truly my destined match

11:18.120 --> 11:19.450
and the man of my dreams.

11:20.350 --> 11:21.810
I was filled with such joy.

11:25.900 --> 11:27.230
Hengsheng… Hengsheng…

11:28.120 --> 11:30.510
I thought it meant
brimming with wit and wisdom.

11:30.510 --> 11:31.770
But actually, it meant

11:32.720 --> 11:35.320
that he was born
in an unusual breech position,

11:35.670 --> 11:37.200
which rendered the labor

11:38.030 --> 11:39.390
extremely perilous.

11:40.670 --> 11:42.000
That he bears such a name

11:42.790 --> 11:44.720
is a testament to his rebellious

11:45.000 --> 11:46.130
and defiant nature.

11:47.960 --> 11:50.020
How could I rely on him for a lifetime?

11:51.200 --> 11:52.130
Someone's dead!

11:52.280 --> 11:54.140
There's a dead man in the library!

12:13.000 --> 12:13.860
Jianglai is...

12:15.550 --> 12:16.310
It's not him.

12:32.150 --> 12:32.910
Jianglai.

12:35.320 --> 12:36.000
Bao.

12:37.670 --> 12:38.400
It's so cold.

12:39.440 --> 12:40.750
The maids screamed in terror

12:40.750 --> 12:41.920
when they saw the body.

12:41.920 --> 12:43.650
I hope you weren't frightened.

12:45.150 --> 12:46.030
You never take

12:46.030 --> 12:47.090
this jade ring off.

12:47.580 --> 12:50.780
The moment I saw it wasn't there,
I knew it could not be you.

12:50.910 --> 12:53.000
Master Jianglai,

12:53.360 --> 12:54.480
are you alright?

12:57.270 --> 12:58.960
Thank goodness you're in one piece.

12:58.960 --> 13:01.150
Thank heavens!

13:03.480 --> 13:04.200
This person

13:04.840 --> 13:06.480
snuck into my room at night.

13:17.440 --> 13:18.240
Young Master!

13:29.510 --> 13:30.310
Young Master!

13:32.670 --> 13:34.000
With no way out,

13:34.720 --> 13:36.190
he swallowed his silver needle

13:36.190 --> 13:37.320
and died on the spot.

13:43.630 --> 13:46.000
Mrs. Xue, what's wrong?

13:46.670 --> 13:47.470
It's nothing.

13:48.870 --> 13:51.440
Miss Rong, unlike you,
who have weathered many storms,

13:51.440 --> 13:53.480
I am just a woman
confined to the inner quarters.

13:53.480 --> 13:54.630
The sight of a corpse

13:54.800 --> 13:56.200
startled me for a moment.

13:56.690 --> 13:58.690
The smell of blood is indeed strong,

13:59.060 --> 14:00.340
making people dizzy.

14:01.630 --> 14:03.560
I have a vial of calming pills here.

14:04.790 --> 14:06.320
Mrs. Xue, please take one.

14:07.860 --> 14:09.910
It's excellent for settling your mind.

14:09.910 --> 14:10.630
Thank you.

14:22.390 --> 14:23.190
Son of a bitch!

14:23.500 --> 14:24.860
This scoundrel somehow

14:24.910 --> 14:25.840
changed into a guard's uniform

14:25.840 --> 14:27.080
and snuck into the mansion
to carry out the assassination.

14:27.080 --> 14:28.140
Truly despicable!

14:28.360 --> 14:29.960
Thankfully, Master Jianglai
was blessed by the gods

14:29.960 --> 14:31.360
and thus spared from harm.

14:31.360 --> 14:32.120
I'll go right away

14:32.120 --> 14:33.240
to report this to the Duke!

14:33.240 --> 14:34.510
We'll conduct a thorough search
of the Duke's Mansion tonight

14:34.510 --> 14:36.440
and find the assassin's accomplices!

14:36.440 --> 14:38.120
Do you really think his accomplices
would just linger here

14:38.120 --> 14:39.780
waiting to be arrested by you?

14:40.670 --> 14:41.200
Yes.

14:41.270 --> 14:42.000
It's late.

14:43.230 --> 14:44.430
No need to make a fuss.

14:44.870 --> 14:45.480
No need to disturb

14:45.480 --> 14:46.630
the Duke and Master Shuyu.

14:46.630 --> 14:49.140
Gather all the gatekeepers
and patrol guards.

14:49.140 --> 14:50.270
Carry the body over there

14:50.270 --> 14:51.480
and ask them to identify it.

14:51.480 --> 14:53.610
Then send two men to keep watch over it.

14:53.790 --> 14:56.850
Tomorrow I'll send for a coroner
to examine the corpse.

14:57.080 --> 14:58.120
Master Jianglai,

14:58.120 --> 14:59.200
you're truly thoughtful.

14:59.200 --> 15:00.120
But after tonight's fight,

15:00.120 --> 15:01.390
this chamber is hardly fit

15:01.390 --> 15:02.440
for habitation anymore.

15:02.440 --> 15:03.670
I'll immediately ask others

15:03.670 --> 15:04.390
to get another room prepared for you.

15:04.390 --> 15:05.790
That won't be necessary.

15:06.080 --> 15:06.750
Tonight,

15:07.080 --> 15:08.610
I'll make do with the study.

15:11.240 --> 15:12.790
Huiqing, you were frightened

15:12.790 --> 15:14.190
and should go rest early.

15:14.510 --> 15:15.240
Steward Xue,

15:15.910 --> 15:18.030
please escort Huiqing back personally.

15:18.030 --> 15:18.630
Yes.

15:19.130 --> 15:20.680
Young Madam, please.

15:29.470 --> 15:31.130
I'll wait for you in the study.

15:31.240 --> 15:32.640
I have questions for you.

15:41.630 --> 15:42.360
Take it away.

16:02.230 --> 16:02.830
Bao.

16:03.630 --> 16:04.630
I was just kicked

16:04.630 --> 16:05.630
by that assassin.

16:06.390 --> 16:08.210
It seems the blow struck deep inside.

16:08.210 --> 16:09.670
I didn't feel a thing then,

16:10.670 --> 16:12.130
but now it suddenly hurts.

16:12.340 --> 16:13.890
I can't bear it anymore, Bao.

16:13.890 --> 16:15.490
I need to lie down for a while.

16:17.910 --> 16:18.550
Bao,

16:20.390 --> 16:22.030
don't you care about me at all?

16:22.030 --> 16:23.200
I'm in such pain.

16:24.150 --> 16:25.270
Come take a look.

16:26.240 --> 16:27.770
Is it swollen from the kick?

16:40.590 --> 16:42.880
Look. Is it right here?

16:49.270 --> 16:51.870
Bao, how heartless you are!

16:52.190 --> 16:54.240
If you put on such an act
to dodge my questions,

16:54.240 --> 16:55.640
then we're done talking.

16:57.000 --> 16:57.550
Bao.

17:00.750 --> 17:02.080
Don't push me like this.

17:04.000 --> 17:06.270
Lu Jianglai, you dare not say it.

17:06.550 --> 17:07.950
Fine, I'll say it for you.

17:08.109 --> 17:10.200
Who hosted the feast you attended today?

17:10.200 --> 17:11.960
What did you eat and drink there?

17:11.960 --> 17:13.290
Someone wants you dead.

17:13.670 --> 17:14.750
Are you truly unaware?

17:14.750 --> 17:16.109
Or are you just playing dumb?

17:16.109 --> 17:17.310
You elder brother, Master Shuyu...

17:17.310 --> 17:18.200
Say no more.

17:20.400 --> 17:22.270
You know everything perfectly well.

17:22.270 --> 17:23.930
Why keep deceiving yourself?

17:26.790 --> 17:27.920
Before I met you,

17:29.640 --> 17:32.310
I was cold-hearted and arrogant.

17:33.770 --> 17:36.200
Confronted by all the villains
in the world,

17:36.200 --> 17:38.060
I struck them down without mercy.

17:38.680 --> 17:40.580
So many corrupt officials at court

17:40.580 --> 17:42.110
hated me and wanted me dead,

17:42.550 --> 17:43.750
but I never flinched.

17:44.640 --> 17:45.510
A person who is all alone

17:45.510 --> 17:46.640
has nothing to fear.

17:48.440 --> 17:49.240
But just now,

17:50.750 --> 17:51.920
I was truly afraid.

17:54.360 --> 17:56.620
For the first time in my life,
I felt fear.

17:57.350 --> 17:58.680
What were you afraid of?

18:03.890 --> 18:05.290
I was afraid that one day,

18:05.920 --> 18:07.850
I would also become just a cold name

18:08.030 --> 18:09.160
in those case files.

18:10.070 --> 18:11.270
I was even more afraid

18:12.590 --> 18:13.830
that my elder brother

18:15.310 --> 18:16.830
was behind all this.

18:20.300 --> 18:21.830
Bao, do you know what he did?

18:22.880 --> 18:24.110
He made little Xun

18:24.920 --> 18:25.680
bring me that jujube cake

18:25.680 --> 18:27.000
laced with sedatives.

18:27.440 --> 18:28.680
To reassure me,

18:29.430 --> 18:30.640
he even put on a show
of humiliating his wife

18:30.640 --> 18:32.830
and disciplining his son in front of me.

18:32.830 --> 18:34.070
He is my only

18:34.070 --> 18:35.440
blood brother

18:35.440 --> 18:36.640
in this whole world.

18:37.240 --> 18:38.790
But he wants me dead.

18:39.960 --> 18:40.590
Bao.

18:42.270 --> 18:43.590
He wants me dead.

18:45.880 --> 18:46.640
I see.

18:47.640 --> 18:49.260
You didn't eat that piece of jujube cake.

18:49.260 --> 18:50.200
Well done.

18:52.200 --> 18:54.000
I kept that piece of jujube cake,

18:54.920 --> 18:56.450
because I wanted to tell you

18:56.790 --> 18:58.590
that you were worrying too much,

18:58.790 --> 18:59.920
that my brother

19:00.260 --> 19:02.120
was as kind-hearted as my mother,

19:02.130 --> 19:03.660
that he valued the bond
between us siblings,

19:03.660 --> 19:05.920
and that he was not as vile
as you thought.

19:06.270 --> 19:07.440
But in the end...

19:09.510 --> 19:10.270
In the end,

19:13.440 --> 19:15.570
I, Lu Jianglai, am fated to be all alone

19:15.920 --> 19:17.310
and cut off from all kin.

19:20.110 --> 19:21.710
No one in this world loves me.

19:28.350 --> 19:30.410
No one in this world will ever love me.

19:38.400 --> 19:39.680
But I'm here, aren't I?

19:41.160 --> 19:42.550
You're not all alone.

19:43.960 --> 19:44.880
Then, will you

19:44.880 --> 19:46.110
by my side forever?

19:56.590 --> 19:57.400
Rong Shanbao!

19:58.590 --> 20:00.050
Do you have another lover?

20:01.140 --> 20:02.340
Why are you so hesitant and evasive

20:02.340 --> 20:03.270
every time

20:03.270 --> 20:04.030
I ask you?

20:04.110 --> 20:05.640
What are you hiding from me?

20:09.110 --> 20:09.840
Of course...

20:11.200 --> 20:11.930
Of course...

20:12.270 --> 20:14.200
This is exactly the tradition
of your Rong family.

20:14.200 --> 20:15.680
The moment I'm not by your side,

20:15.680 --> 20:16.400
someone will immediately

20:16.400 --> 20:17.240
take my place!

20:18.270 --> 20:19.730
Even if you're unwilling,

20:20.110 --> 20:22.110
your grandmother, your sisters,

20:22.110 --> 20:22.640
and those

20:22.640 --> 20:24.440
foolish men with ill intentions

20:24.510 --> 20:25.200
will all try

20:25.200 --> 20:27.330
to deceive you with their sweet words.

20:30.720 --> 20:31.350
Who is it?

20:33.440 --> 20:34.500
Is it Cheng Guanyu?

20:36.680 --> 20:38.210
Or is it your cousin Wen Can?

20:40.110 --> 20:41.640
Who the hell is it, Bao?

20:42.330 --> 20:43.440
Who the hell is it?

20:43.440 --> 20:44.550
Or which stranger is it?

20:44.550 --> 20:45.350
Tell me!

20:45.350 --> 20:46.350
Who the hell is it?

20:47.640 --> 20:49.170
I don't have another lover.

20:49.830 --> 20:50.690
Then promise me

20:51.440 --> 20:52.240
that if you do,

20:52.590 --> 20:53.750
you must tell me.

20:55.270 --> 20:56.470
And what if I tell you?

20:57.360 --> 20:58.640
Then I will stuff

20:58.640 --> 20:59.590
that despicable thief

20:59.590 --> 21:00.850
back into his rat hole.

21:01.340 --> 21:02.600
And then I will hide you

21:02.920 --> 21:03.720
in a place no one

21:03.720 --> 21:04.850
but me can ever find.

21:05.400 --> 21:06.400
Unless you swear

21:06.520 --> 21:07.640
that you'll never leave me again

21:07.640 --> 21:09.170
and never abandon me again!

21:35.420 --> 21:39.330
♪ The music of fairies and jade flutes ♪

21:39.720 --> 21:44.360
♪ The wine in the cup is as clear
as jade dew with graceful sword dances ♪

21:41.480 --> 21:42.540
Alright, alright.

21:43.750 --> 21:44.720
I promise you

21:44.390 --> 21:47.440
♪ There are refined scholars
in white robes ♪

21:45.590 --> 21:47.850
that there's absolutely no other lover.

21:48.510 --> 21:50.350
Although your anger
is totally unwarranted,

21:48.920 --> 21:52.870
♪ The new hall is further adorned
with intricate gold carvings ♪

21:51.070 --> 21:52.310
I'm still glad

21:52.960 --> 21:54.400
that I can pull you out of your sorrow

21:53.350 --> 21:55.950
♪ The sound of Konghou is echoing ♪

21:54.400 --> 21:55.310
and despair.

21:56.480 --> 21:57.720
You are Lu Jianglai, after all.

21:56.710 --> 22:01.620
♪ With a stroke of ink,
I wrote a poem to show my passion ♪

21:58.480 --> 22:00.140
Jiang Yiqian was so scheming,

22:00.200 --> 22:01.210
cunning and ruthless,

22:01.210 --> 22:02.320
yet he couldn't intimidate you.

22:02.320 --> 22:06.120
♪ The jade-adorned robe and the long sword
embody grace and talent ♪

22:03.510 --> 22:05.030
As long as you don't care
about him,

22:05.030 --> 22:06.270
you are invincible.

22:06.490 --> 22:08.860
♪ The mountains and rivers
never miss the past ♪

22:07.440 --> 22:08.000
I'll let you

22:08.000 --> 22:09.170
dwell on your sorrow
for just a little while.

22:09.170 --> 22:15.120
♪ Writing poems to show my passion,
I have no worry ♪

22:09.790 --> 22:10.960
Tomorrow morning,

22:11.590 --> 22:13.450
you'll have to be yourself again.

22:13.960 --> 22:15.000
At least tonight,

22:15.590 --> 22:17.480
at this very moment,

22:15.790 --> 22:18.370
♪ They say the Reclusive Immortal
can hardly stay in the celestial palace ♪

22:18.110 --> 22:19.030
I will go nowhere

22:18.840 --> 22:21.870
♪ Descending to the mortal world,
he indulges in wine in a grand mansion ♪

22:19.680 --> 22:21.480
and stay right here by your side.

22:22.330 --> 22:24.120
♪ Eyes full of affection ♪

22:22.510 --> 22:23.070
Really?

22:24.140 --> 22:28.280
♪ How many scrolls of poetry
have been written with his ink? ♪

22:24.380 --> 22:24.980
Of course.

22:28.910 --> 22:32.090
♪ Pouring the strongest wine
in the world ♪

22:32.280 --> 22:35.350
♪ Reclining on the lofty tower
of Chang'an ♪

22:35.680 --> 22:42.380
♪ Wondering who in the whole wide world
could be carefree like him ♪

22:47.310 --> 22:48.200
The guards in the mansion

22:48.200 --> 22:50.200
all claim they've never seen this person.

22:50.200 --> 22:52.200
I've ordered people
to search the entire mansion.

22:52.200 --> 22:54.440
I believe we'll get to the bottom of this
soon.

22:54.440 --> 22:55.640
Your Highness, I hope

22:56.540 --> 22:58.110
you can grant me three more days.

22:58.110 --> 22:59.110
You just said

22:59.960 --> 23:02.270
Jianglai had forbidden
anyone in the mansion to look into this

23:02.270 --> 23:04.240
and intended to bring in outside help,
right?

23:04.240 --> 23:04.830
Yes.

23:05.070 --> 23:08.470
So, he suspects there's an accomplice
hidden in the mansion.

23:09.750 --> 23:11.570
The fact that an assassin could sneak in
so easily

23:11.570 --> 23:14.100
proves you're all nothing
but useless fools!

23:14.590 --> 23:14.960
Yes.

23:14.960 --> 23:16.920
The guards on patrol duty last night

23:16.920 --> 23:18.520
will each receive 30 lashes.

23:18.830 --> 23:19.270
Yes.

23:19.510 --> 23:20.590
Including you!

23:21.960 --> 23:22.480
Yes.

23:22.640 --> 23:23.200
Get out!

23:24.200 --> 23:24.720
Yes.

23:34.000 --> 23:34.590
Xun.

23:37.120 --> 23:38.040
Come over to me.

23:41.510 --> 23:42.240
Grandfather.

23:42.240 --> 23:44.030
I've finished all the homework

23:44.050 --> 23:45.420
you assigned me.

23:45.450 --> 23:47.530
Really? Let me have a look.

23:49.590 --> 23:52.030
Well done. Quite impressive.

23:53.350 --> 23:55.350
Your Highness, I heard from Xun

23:55.720 --> 23:57.310
that you've been troubled lately.

23:57.310 --> 23:57.790
I assume it's because

23:57.790 --> 23:59.750
you're concerned about Jianglai's matter.

23:59.750 --> 24:01.350
I've made some Fuling cakes.

24:01.880 --> 24:03.350
The doctor says
they can strengthen the vital energy,

24:03.350 --> 24:04.270
calm the spirit,

24:04.270 --> 24:05.830
and even promote longevity.

24:05.830 --> 24:08.030
This is the perfect season to have them.

24:08.240 --> 24:09.590
You're thoughtful.

24:10.240 --> 24:11.170
Leave them here.

24:11.630 --> 24:12.220
Yes.

24:20.840 --> 24:21.390
Xun.

24:22.830 --> 24:23.510
Want some?

24:28.160 --> 24:28.890
Here you are.

24:29.200 --> 24:30.460
Xun, you eat one first.

24:30.880 --> 24:32.000
Thank you, Grandfather.

24:32.000 --> 24:32.590
No.

24:40.200 --> 24:41.270
He hit you again?

24:41.750 --> 24:42.270
No.

24:42.720 --> 24:43.550
I hurt myself

24:43.550 --> 24:44.550
by accident.

24:44.750 --> 24:46.350
It had nothing to do with him.

24:48.550 --> 24:50.150
-What a scoundrel!
-Mother!

24:52.310 --> 24:53.170
It's all right.

24:54.200 --> 24:55.400
Xun, don't be afraid.

24:55.620 --> 24:57.080
I'm not talking about you.

24:59.400 --> 25:01.000
Grandfather, please eat it.

25:01.240 --> 25:02.780
You'll feel better after eating it.

25:02.780 --> 25:05.910
The Fuling cake tastes much better
than the jujube cake.

25:09.640 --> 25:10.570
The jujube cake?

25:10.960 --> 25:13.360
Father told me to send it
to Uncle Jianglai.

25:14.480 --> 25:16.040
What happened to your manners?

25:16.040 --> 25:17.880
Before your grandfather,
you must observe the strictest etiquette.

25:17.880 --> 25:18.790
Do not speak recklessly of matters

25:18.790 --> 25:20.650
your elders have not asked about.

25:21.030 --> 25:23.380
Your Highness, Xun has been suffering
from indigestion.

25:23.380 --> 25:24.510
He shouldn't eat too many pastries.

25:24.510 --> 25:25.770
I'll take him back now.

25:25.920 --> 25:26.480
Wait.

25:27.960 --> 25:30.920
Xun, come over here.

25:39.590 --> 25:42.530
You just said your father

25:42.560 --> 25:45.490
told you to send a jujube cake
to your Uncle Jianglai.

25:54.860 --> 25:56.720
[Harmonious Radiance]

25:58.000 --> 25:59.550
Mr. Lang, this way, please.

26:07.350 --> 26:09.120
You're walking so slowly.
It's driving me crazy!

26:09.120 --> 26:09.920
Hurry up!

26:10.640 --> 26:12.070
Shanbao chose to remain
at the Duke's Mansion.

26:12.070 --> 26:13.530
She must have her reasons.

26:13.640 --> 26:14.000
You

26:14.000 --> 26:15.640
rushed over in such a panic

26:16.270 --> 26:19.070
only because of the mission
Grandmother gave you.

26:19.350 --> 26:20.070
Grandmother carefully selected

26:20.070 --> 26:21.880
these men for Shanbao.

26:22.110 --> 26:23.800
You already have Mr. Bai by your side.

26:23.800 --> 26:25.260
Don't even think about it.

26:26.750 --> 26:28.640
Grandmother said she was done meddling,

26:28.640 --> 26:29.680
yet only a few days later,

26:29.680 --> 26:31.270
she's already worrying again.

26:31.270 --> 26:32.960
As long as Shanbao
doesn't neglect her duties,

26:32.960 --> 26:34.820
what does it matter who she likes?

26:35.030 --> 26:36.480
I wouldn't put it that way.

26:36.480 --> 26:37.440
Lu Jianglai is about
to be formally recognized

26:37.440 --> 26:38.440
as the Duke's son.

26:38.510 --> 26:40.400
Soon, he'll be matched with some
noble lady from a prominent family.

26:40.400 --> 26:41.930
Shanbao can't fall behind.

26:42.350 --> 26:42.880
This time,

26:42.880 --> 26:45.030
Grandmother personally selected
more than 10 candidates,

26:45.030 --> 26:47.310
each rivaling him
in both appearance and talent.

26:47.310 --> 26:49.240
Not just the families from Jiangnan
are eager to make a move.

26:49.240 --> 26:49.750
Even Cousin Wen

26:49.750 --> 26:51.680
has sent two letters to ask about it.

26:51.680 --> 26:53.580
This is the Duke of Yongguo's Mansion.

26:53.580 --> 26:55.310
Lu Jianglai isn't someone to mess with.

26:55.310 --> 26:56.160
I advise you

26:56.160 --> 26:58.240
to put away this precious booklet at once.

26:58.240 --> 26:59.900
Otherwise, if he finds out...

27:02.070 --> 27:02.550
How about

27:02.550 --> 27:05.480
I take a look for Shanbao
and see which one stands out?

27:06.110 --> 27:07.400
Hurry! Hide it away!

27:21.790 --> 27:22.550
Excuse me,

27:22.680 --> 27:24.480
could you please return my ball?

27:28.920 --> 27:31.310
This little girl
has such beautiful features.

27:31.310 --> 27:32.400
So pretty.

27:32.720 --> 27:33.790
What's your name?

27:34.240 --> 27:35.880
Why are you playing here alone?

27:35.880 --> 27:36.880
My name is Xuanyu.

27:36.920 --> 27:38.110
I'm not alone.

27:38.110 --> 27:39.000
I'm with...

27:42.720 --> 27:43.650
Lady Xuanyu!

27:44.680 --> 27:45.410
Lady Xuanyu!

27:48.960 --> 27:49.880
Lady Xuanyu,

27:50.110 --> 27:51.240
I just went back to fetch something,

27:51.240 --> 27:53.030
and in the blink of an eye, you ran off.

27:53.030 --> 27:55.760
Madam Chang will be worried
if she can't find you.

27:57.380 --> 27:58.010
Let's go.

27:59.920 --> 28:00.960
If only I had

28:00.960 --> 28:02.880
such a clever and adorable daughter.

28:02.880 --> 28:03.350
I should keep

28:03.350 --> 28:05.350
one man from the booklet for myself.

28:07.840 --> 28:09.170
What are you looking at?

28:09.470 --> 28:10.670
Nothing. Let's go.

28:24.160 --> 28:26.820
When did those outsiders arrive
at the mansion?

28:27.160 --> 28:28.560
Find out and report back.

28:29.640 --> 28:30.200
Yes.

28:34.730 --> 28:35.480
The coroner retrieved

28:35.480 --> 28:36.400
the silver needle that the deceased

28:36.400 --> 28:37.270
had swallowed.

28:37.830 --> 28:39.300
Since the pathways within the head

28:39.300 --> 28:41.240
are all linked, even a needle this fine,

28:41.240 --> 28:42.880
when driven
with precisely calculated force,

28:42.880 --> 28:44.720
could pierce through the ear canal
into the brain,

28:44.720 --> 28:46.310
causing instant death.

28:46.920 --> 28:48.310
Afterwards, the needle could

28:48.310 --> 28:49.970
be pulled out without a trace.

28:50.050 --> 28:51.410
Even after the coroner's examination,

28:51.410 --> 28:53.130
no evidence would be found.

28:54.790 --> 28:55.350
Judging

28:55.350 --> 28:57.680
from how the assassin committed suicide,

28:57.750 --> 28:59.680
he was clearly very professional.

29:00.390 --> 29:01.980
A highly paid assassin?

29:03.440 --> 29:04.920
Who have you offended, My Lord?

29:04.920 --> 29:07.830
They even dared to break
into the Duke's Mansion to kill you.

29:07.830 --> 29:09.030
I'll be more careful.

29:11.880 --> 29:13.210
Thank you for your help.

29:13.640 --> 29:15.510
My Lord, since you've asked me
to be your helper,

29:15.510 --> 29:17.110
why won't you speak plainly?

29:17.510 --> 29:18.270
Is there

29:19.270 --> 29:21.350
anything you can't bring yourself to say?

29:21.350 --> 29:22.000
I...

29:23.880 --> 29:25.710
My Lord, Mrs. Xue is here.

29:29.920 --> 29:30.640
Let her in.

29:37.200 --> 29:39.510
Jianglai, I've come unbidden
to beg for your help.

29:39.510 --> 29:40.510
Please, don't say that.

29:40.510 --> 29:42.570
You can just tell me what's happened.

29:42.640 --> 29:43.200
Your brother

29:43.200 --> 29:44.890
has been taken away by the Duke's men.

29:44.890 --> 29:46.200
I beg you to put aside past grievances

29:46.200 --> 29:47.200
and save his life.

29:48.120 --> 29:48.920
Save his life?

29:54.820 --> 29:56.240
The Duke truly has sharp eyes

29:56.240 --> 29:57.710
and sees through every ruse.

29:57.710 --> 29:58.880
He knows

29:59.160 --> 29:59.920
everything

29:59.920 --> 30:01.400
you've done.

30:02.110 --> 30:04.350
I advise you to admit your fault

30:04.960 --> 30:06.360
and beg for forgiveness.

30:06.880 --> 30:08.010
Father, I am foolish

30:08.850 --> 30:10.640
and don't know what I've done wrong.

30:10.640 --> 30:12.590
Father, I beg you to tell me my fault.

30:12.590 --> 30:15.030
You asked Xun to send the jujube cake,
didn't you?

30:15.030 --> 30:17.640
Yes, I asked him to send it.

30:20.240 --> 30:22.640
Someone laced the jujube cake
with sleeping draughts,

30:22.640 --> 30:24.640
which were enough
to make a person unconscious.

30:24.640 --> 30:25.830
Do you know that your brother

30:25.830 --> 30:27.550
was attacked by assassins last night?

30:27.550 --> 30:27.960
I...

30:28.830 --> 30:30.160
I knew nothing about it.

30:30.240 --> 30:30.920
Fine.

30:32.120 --> 30:33.920
Then the beating will continue,

30:34.550 --> 30:36.210
until you admit what you know!

30:44.720 --> 30:45.850
Father, you suspect

30:46.920 --> 30:49.050
I'm the one who wants
to kill Jianglai?

30:49.200 --> 30:50.110
Other than you,

30:51.480 --> 30:53.280
who else hates him so deeply?

30:54.030 --> 30:55.070
From the very day I brought

30:55.070 --> 30:56.670
Jianglai into this mansion,

30:57.030 --> 30:59.720
you've been guarding against him,
sowing discord between us,

30:59.720 --> 31:01.920
and trying every means to drive him out!

31:02.050 --> 31:02.770
His servant

31:02.800 --> 31:05.240
managed to get out of the mansion
and send word outside.

31:05.240 --> 31:07.300
Wasn't it you who pulled the strings?

31:08.030 --> 31:09.400
I simply didn't bother

31:10.640 --> 31:12.240
to expose such petty tricks.

31:13.110 --> 31:14.200
I am a cripple,

31:14.960 --> 31:16.790
who cannot uphold the Xue family's name.

31:16.790 --> 31:18.400
Everyone in the mansion knows

31:18.400 --> 31:19.640
that you brought him back

31:19.640 --> 31:20.720
to replace me!

31:21.680 --> 31:23.620
So it's only natural
that I was wary of him

31:23.620 --> 31:24.960
and kept my distance!

31:25.350 --> 31:26.810
Is that such a grave crime?

31:27.480 --> 31:29.000
But I never sent anyone to kill him.

31:29.000 --> 31:29.830
Never!

31:30.550 --> 31:31.830
I can swear to God!

31:32.160 --> 31:33.560
You still dare to deny it?

31:36.160 --> 31:37.750
You're mediocre yourself,

31:38.550 --> 31:40.620
yet you're jealous of those with talent.

31:40.620 --> 31:41.950
You even want to harm

31:41.970 --> 31:42.790
your own brother.

31:42.790 --> 31:44.190
You're truly monstrous!

31:44.970 --> 31:46.730
I'll give you one last chance.

31:46.990 --> 31:48.950
If you did it, admit it.

31:49.440 --> 31:52.100
Be a man
and take responsibility for your deeds!

31:54.210 --> 31:55.050
It wasn't me!

31:55.670 --> 31:56.730
I plead not guilty!

32:04.070 --> 32:05.030
I never thought

32:06.310 --> 32:07.790
that jealousy could breed

32:08.270 --> 32:09.200
such a beastly heart

32:09.200 --> 32:10.960
in my own son,

32:11.400 --> 32:13.880
driving him to commit this inhumane crime.

32:21.480 --> 32:22.280
Take him away!

32:23.140 --> 32:25.200
Cleanse his wicked heart with water!

32:25.820 --> 32:27.940
Master Shuyu, forgive me.

32:32.790 --> 32:33.510
Father!

32:33.990 --> 32:34.790
I didn't do it!

32:35.400 --> 32:37.310
I never sent anyone
to assassinate my brother!

32:37.310 --> 32:39.440
Someone was deliberately framing me!

32:39.550 --> 32:41.480
Father, don't be deceived by them!

32:41.590 --> 32:42.400
Father!

32:44.040 --> 32:46.000
Look at this Mr. Ye.

32:46.270 --> 32:48.440
He is handsome and well-educated.

32:49.270 --> 32:52.310
His looks can rival those of the paragons
of male beauty.

32:52.310 --> 32:54.270
It is said that every time he goes out,

32:54.270 --> 32:55.870
he attracts crowds of women,

32:55.880 --> 32:57.300
his carriage filled
with gifts from admirers.

32:57.300 --> 32:58.960
He also comes from an esteemed family,

32:58.960 --> 33:00.200
proud and arrogant.

33:00.230 --> 33:01.340
He's determined

33:01.370 --> 33:03.350
to marry a noble lady
of both beauty and talent.

33:03.350 --> 33:05.880
Girls from ordinary families
could never hope to match him.

33:05.880 --> 33:07.710
I'm discussing important matters
with Yunshu.

33:07.710 --> 33:08.710
Do not disrupt us.

33:11.030 --> 33:11.830
I'm here

33:11.830 --> 33:13.200
on Grandmother's orders.

33:13.200 --> 33:14.830
How is that disrupting anything?

33:14.830 --> 33:15.890
Take another look.

33:16.270 --> 33:19.070
If you don't like this one,
you can choose another.

33:27.960 --> 33:30.260
Xiu Qiong,
you should have spoken up earlier.

33:30.260 --> 33:30.880
I thought

33:30.880 --> 33:32.880
it was that jealous man coming over.

33:33.400 --> 33:34.200
Lady Shanbao.

33:34.400 --> 33:35.750
The Duke is interrogating Master Shuyu.

33:35.750 --> 33:37.880
Lord Lu has rushed over to Baoshi Hall.

33:46.440 --> 33:47.770
Lord Lu is facing a difficult matter,

33:47.770 --> 33:49.030
and you won't help him?

33:49.550 --> 33:52.960
Whether it's difficult, domestic, joyous

33:53.550 --> 33:54.590
or disastrous

33:55.160 --> 33:56.760
all depends on his decision.

33:57.690 --> 33:58.950
Others can't help him.

33:59.680 --> 34:02.210
In the end,
he must make the decision himself.

34:05.000 --> 34:07.270
Yunshu, I have to trouble you

34:07.880 --> 34:09.409
to look into someone for me.

34:36.190 --> 34:37.389
I really didn't do it.

34:37.580 --> 34:38.550
I really didn't.

34:39.400 --> 34:40.330
I really didn't.

34:49.840 --> 34:50.969
It's freezing cold!

34:52.389 --> 34:54.050
You've finally come to see me.

34:55.230 --> 34:56.360
This damn wretch

34:56.380 --> 34:58.440
dared to plot to kill his own brother.

34:58.550 --> 35:00.360
I am seeking justice for you.

35:01.190 --> 35:02.450
You need not stop them.

35:03.070 --> 35:03.960
Even if he were

35:03.960 --> 35:05.290
truly guilty of murder,

35:05.970 --> 35:07.670
you couldn't just take the law
into your own hands.

35:07.670 --> 35:08.360
As for me,

35:08.810 --> 35:10.940
I don't need you to seek justice for me.

35:12.030 --> 35:13.030
You're unworthy.

35:13.760 --> 35:16.030
How dare you!

36:04.730 --> 36:06.260
Your Highness, be careful!

36:16.960 --> 36:18.560
I truly did not misjudge you.

36:20.280 --> 36:22.540
Our Xue family finally has a worthy heir.

36:23.230 --> 36:24.360
Bring Xun out!

36:24.630 --> 36:25.400
Yes.

36:32.800 --> 36:33.510
Look.

36:33.990 --> 36:35.320
Even your own son

36:35.350 --> 36:37.080
isn't willing to plead for you.

36:37.190 --> 36:38.710
What a pathetic failure

36:38.920 --> 36:40.230
you are as a father!

36:41.630 --> 36:44.150
Jianglai, this is your own nephew.

36:44.590 --> 36:46.400
When you inherit my title,

36:46.720 --> 36:48.850
you must treat him and his mother well.

36:49.150 --> 36:49.880
As for your

36:49.880 --> 36:51.480
good-for-nothing brother,

36:51.670 --> 36:53.760
he shall be exiled to a monastery
to live in seclusion

36:53.760 --> 36:56.290
and atone for his sins
for the rest of his life.

36:57.960 --> 37:01.490
How do you know I am capable
of shouldering the responsibility?

37:01.710 --> 37:04.370
I have kept a close eye on you
for quite some time.

37:04.470 --> 37:06.300
What you've done in Linjin

37:06.760 --> 37:08.280
shows that you're resolute

37:08.280 --> 37:09.320
and decisive.

37:09.320 --> 37:10.230
You are the spitting image

37:10.230 --> 37:11.400
of my younger self!

37:12.440 --> 37:14.000
How could I possibly be mistaken?

37:14.000 --> 37:14.590
Fine.

37:16.440 --> 37:18.100
You asked me to treat Xun well.

37:18.510 --> 37:19.680
But when Xun grows up

37:20.190 --> 37:21.760
and asks me

37:22.320 --> 37:24.220
why I seized his father's title

37:24.660 --> 37:26.940
and drove his father out
of the Xue family,

37:26.940 --> 37:28.270
how should I answer him?

37:30.330 --> 37:32.060
Shuyu is willing to step aside.

37:32.330 --> 37:33.860
You didn't seize anything.

37:33.880 --> 37:34.910
Everything in this household

37:34.910 --> 37:36.160
will be given to you by me.

37:36.160 --> 37:37.690
Who dares to question that?

37:38.760 --> 37:41.630
Jianglai, what I want is a wolf.

37:42.160 --> 37:44.690
I want a leader wolf
that can command the pack.

37:44.800 --> 37:46.760
Everything I earned on the battlefield

37:46.760 --> 37:47.440
can only be given to someone

37:47.440 --> 37:49.570
who will bring glory to our Xue family.

37:50.030 --> 37:51.070
Xun is too young,

37:51.510 --> 37:53.360
but you are in your prime!

37:56.070 --> 37:59.000
So your plan is
that I replace my elder brother,

37:59.790 --> 38:01.340
and my nephew succeeds me.

38:01.820 --> 38:04.050
But what if I have children
of my own in the future

38:04.050 --> 38:05.850
and refuse to give the title to Xun?

38:05.850 --> 38:07.730
Power and titles

38:07.980 --> 38:09.630
only breed more hatred

38:10.440 --> 38:11.210
and agony,

38:11.860 --> 38:13.260
just like they did to you.

38:13.540 --> 38:14.280
You already had

38:14.280 --> 38:15.550
a beloved wife,

38:15.790 --> 38:16.990
yet to get more heirs,

38:17.480 --> 38:19.770
you took one concubine after another.

38:20.440 --> 38:21.850
You brought them into this household,

38:21.850 --> 38:23.850
but you did nothing
to stop your wife's jealousy,

38:23.850 --> 38:25.390
standing by as they were bullied!

38:25.390 --> 38:27.000
You drove my mother
into a life of wandering,

38:27.000 --> 38:27.880
leaving her with no one to rely on.

38:27.880 --> 38:29.740
You made me suffer
all the hardships of the world

38:29.740 --> 38:31.800
and endure the cold stares of others!

38:32.000 --> 38:33.930
They all said I was a servant's son.

38:34.170 --> 38:35.250
But so what?

38:36.040 --> 38:37.690
The lowborn servant

38:37.720 --> 38:39.850
was willing to take my mother and me in.

38:40.320 --> 38:41.660
He spent everything he had

38:41.660 --> 38:42.630
supporting my education.

38:42.630 --> 38:43.940
His moral character

38:44.800 --> 38:47.000
was a thousand times nobler than yours.

38:49.840 --> 38:50.800
What did you say?

38:50.820 --> 38:52.080
I said you're selfish!

38:52.370 --> 38:54.300
You imprisoned me in your mansion,

38:54.560 --> 38:55.630
not because you missed

38:55.630 --> 38:56.800
your long-lost son.

38:57.720 --> 38:59.730
You never cared how much I had suffered

38:59.730 --> 39:01.530
or what hardships I had endured.

39:02.370 --> 39:03.300
You really think

39:03.440 --> 39:04.950
that I would be grateful and overjoyed

39:04.950 --> 39:06.310
when offered

39:06.500 --> 39:07.540
this title?

39:08.290 --> 39:09.920
You didn't even bother to ask

39:10.970 --> 39:12.780
when my mother passed away,

39:12.810 --> 39:14.040
or where she was buried!

39:14.040 --> 39:16.040
You don't deserve to be her husband!

39:16.660 --> 39:17.890
Your actions

39:18.640 --> 39:20.440
have made my own brother fear me.

39:22.110 --> 39:24.370
He fears
that I will usurp his noble title.

39:24.370 --> 39:27.120
He even fears
that I'll drive him to his death.

39:29.120 --> 39:30.120
He's my brother.

39:30.150 --> 39:31.950
He and I share the same mother!

39:33.300 --> 39:34.180
Yet you are

39:35.210 --> 39:36.810
forcing us to turn against each other

39:36.810 --> 39:37.880
with your own hands!

39:37.880 --> 39:38.520
You

39:38.960 --> 39:40.690
don't deserve to be our father!

39:55.510 --> 39:57.840
I was fighting battles on the front lines.

39:58.190 --> 39:59.440
How could I have cared

39:59.440 --> 40:01.440
about my women's petty jealousies?

40:01.880 --> 40:04.210
It pains me deeply
that you and your mother

40:04.330 --> 40:06.060
were driven out of the mansion.

40:08.340 --> 40:09.880
As for your brother,

40:10.620 --> 40:11.920
his jealousy toward you

40:11.920 --> 40:14.120
stems from his own narrow-mindedness.

40:14.630 --> 40:15.690
Do you understand?

40:41.440 --> 40:42.030
Shuyu.

40:44.760 --> 40:45.440
Let's go.

40:47.550 --> 40:48.800
Hate me if you must.

40:49.510 --> 40:50.980
But if you give up everything

40:50.980 --> 40:52.880
in the Duke's Mansion just out of hatred,

40:52.880 --> 40:53.880
then you'll truly be

40:53.880 --> 40:55.630
the biggest fool in the world!

40:58.480 --> 40:59.810
Your Highness, this...

41:02.320 --> 41:03.440
A man who has lost all hope

41:03.440 --> 41:05.040
wouldn't argue so fiercely.

41:05.580 --> 41:07.580
He cares about his brother

41:07.600 --> 41:09.330
and even more about his nephew.

41:10.070 --> 41:10.800
In the end,

41:12.280 --> 41:13.280
he will lower

41:13.280 --> 41:15.150
his proud head in front of me.

41:21.840 --> 41:22.360
Here.

41:30.960 --> 41:32.220
Hurry! Bring the brazier!

41:32.220 --> 41:33.350
The brazier! Hurry!

41:45.550 --> 41:46.880
Are you feeling better?

42:17.960 --> 42:18.760
Master Shuyu,

42:20.320 --> 42:22.070
I heard you had caught a cold,

42:22.480 --> 42:24.030
so I specially prepared some ginger soup
for you.

42:24.030 --> 42:26.690
Drink it while it's hot.
It'll ward off the cold.

42:34.590 --> 42:35.110
You...

42:36.520 --> 42:37.210
Get out.

42:39.030 --> 42:40.000
Master Shuyu,

42:40.280 --> 42:42.000
why is your face deathly pale?

42:42.000 --> 42:43.200
It's so frightening.

42:43.480 --> 42:44.840
Why not let me

42:44.840 --> 42:45.960
stay here and attend to you?

42:45.960 --> 42:46.550
Get out!

42:51.110 --> 42:53.440
Yes, Master Shuyu.

42:53.630 --> 42:54.880
Do drink the soup while it's still hot.

42:54.880 --> 42:56.320
It won't be effective if it turns cold.

42:56.320 --> 42:58.120
And all my effort will be wasted.

43:43.440 --> 43:44.100
Let me do it.

44:04.590 --> 44:05.590
When I was little,

44:07.600 --> 44:09.130
Mother used to comb my hair.

44:09.960 --> 44:12.490
It's a pity
that I didn't understand back then

44:13.320 --> 44:15.120
why she always made two portions

44:15.810 --> 44:17.340
of jujube cakes every time.

44:18.030 --> 44:20.030
She would often stare at me blankly.

44:21.140 --> 44:22.350
I only realized later

44:24.000 --> 44:24.660
that Mother

44:26.760 --> 44:28.400
was missing her other son.

44:30.030 --> 44:31.560
Before Mother passed away,

44:31.960 --> 44:34.890
she held my hand tightly,
refusing to close her eyes.

44:36.090 --> 44:37.420
She was unwilling to go.

44:41.030 --> 44:43.360
She couldn't accept that before she died,

44:46.480 --> 44:48.540
she never got to see you one last time.

44:52.150 --> 44:52.750
All right.

45:05.960 --> 45:08.800
So, Shuyu, you don't need to worry.

45:10.550 --> 45:12.550
I will never fight you for anything.

45:15.110 --> 45:16.570
You don't want to fight me,

45:17.840 --> 45:20.670
but I did think about killing you.

45:21.840 --> 45:23.640
I couldn't bring myself to do it.

45:23.880 --> 45:24.920
I hesitated.

45:25.450 --> 45:27.050
Jianglai, believe me.

45:27.760 --> 45:29.490
I never sent anyone to kill you.

45:29.960 --> 45:31.230
If I really had done it,

45:32.170 --> 45:33.860
may I be pierced by a thousand arrows

45:33.860 --> 45:35.260
and die a horrible death.

45:39.980 --> 45:42.100
All right. I see.

45:43.500 --> 45:44.700
Don't be distressed.

45:48.110 --> 45:49.190
It's getting late.

45:50.440 --> 45:51.640
Shuyu, get some rest.

45:52.960 --> 45:54.760
I'll come to see you another day.

45:55.900 --> 45:56.500
Jianglai!

45:58.150 --> 46:00.400
I know you don't believe me.

46:02.030 --> 46:02.590
But

46:04.070 --> 46:05.870
could you tell me more about her?

48:45.440 --> 48:47.870
[Two ways to pronounce the words for tea
in different languages]

48:51.400 --> 48:51.990
Bao.

48:52.800 --> 48:53.880
I was just kicked

48:53.900 --> 48:54.900
by that assassin.

48:55.510 --> 48:57.400
It seems the blow struck deep inside.

48:57.400 --> 48:58.860
I didn't feel a thing then,

48:59.790 --> 49:01.310
but now it suddenly hurts.

49:01.490 --> 49:03.080
I can't bear it anymore, Bao.

49:03.080 --> 49:04.680
I need to lie down for a while.

49:07.110 --> 49:07.960
Bao,

49:09.540 --> 49:11.200
don't you care about me at all?

49:11.230 --> 49:12.670
I'm in such pain.

49:13.360 --> 49:14.590
Come take a look.

49:15.440 --> 49:16.970
Is it swollen from the kick?

49:20.230 --> 49:22.450
[The language of tea knows no borders]

49:22.550 --> 49:24.400
With the global expansion
of the tea trade,

49:24.400 --> 49:25.190
the development of tea culture

49:25.190 --> 49:26.840
has also swept the world.

49:27.150 --> 49:28.190
As many people know,

49:28.190 --> 49:30.150
in different languages around the world,

49:30.150 --> 49:31.670
with a few exceptions,

49:31.670 --> 49:32.590
there are only two ways

49:32.590 --> 49:34.320
to pronounce the words for tea:

49:34.380 --> 49:35.930
"cha" or "tea."

49:36.200 --> 49:38.200
For instance, it's "cha"

49:38.230 --> 49:39.490
in Russian and Korean,

49:39.540 --> 49:40.930
while it's "tea"

49:41.130 --> 49:42.930
in French and Spanish.

49:43.280 --> 49:45.130
Why does tea from China

49:45.160 --> 49:47.190
have two different pronunciations?

49:47.190 --> 49:48.320
This is mainly

49:48.400 --> 49:49.550
because Chinese tea

49:49.550 --> 49:50.920
was introduced to overseas regions

49:50.920 --> 49:51.920
in different ways.

49:51.920 --> 49:52.760
The regions

49:52.760 --> 49:54.880
that imported tea from nothern China
via the Land Silk Road

49:54.880 --> 49:56.480
or through tributary trade

49:56.710 --> 49:57.360
were more likely

49:57.360 --> 49:59.030
to have interactions with
northern China.

49:59.030 --> 50:01.030
Most areas in northern China

50:01.050 --> 50:02.250
refer to tea as "cha."

50:02.440 --> 50:03.100
As a result,

50:03.230 --> 50:05.150
the regions that obtained tea

50:05.150 --> 50:05.840
via the Land Silk Road

50:05.840 --> 50:07.230
and tributary trade

50:07.440 --> 50:08.800
almost all adopted
the pronunciation of "cha"

50:08.800 --> 50:10.260
or a similar variant of it.

50:10.630 --> 50:12.510
As the Maritime Silk Road

50:12.510 --> 50:13.710
rose to prominence,

50:13.750 --> 50:14.660
large quantities of tea

50:14.660 --> 50:16.150
were shipped out
from the Port of Quanzhou,

50:16.150 --> 50:18.680
bringing the pronunciation of "tea"

50:18.710 --> 50:20.310
in Hokkien to the world.
